  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4903.02 Field Experience",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4903.02 Field Experience. For the purpose of this part, field experience shall mean that an applicant shall provide documentation from his or her past or present employer attesting to hours of experience on the job relevant to the certificate being applied for.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4900.html"
